{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2611639,"known_for_department":"Crew","name":"Bartosz Mikołajczyk","original_name":"Bartosz Mikołajczyk","popularity":0.1978,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":696141,"title":"Henry the Dealer","original_title":"Heniek","overview":"Maciek, Beata, Jacek and Heniek have been working together as car dealers for years. One day a policeman arrives at their workplace and inquires about Heniek, suggesting that the man leads a double life. As Heniek has just taken a few days off, his three colleagues undertake individual investigations into his real identity. Outwardly not believing in his guilt, in secret, they look for proof that Heniek is a gangster and for the loot he presumably stole. But is Heniek really a crook?","poster_path":"/tHGFyLcspzUhBivQhFpiywvSAxV.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[18,35,80],"popularity":1.4216,"release_date":"2012-06-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}